Models
------

No model weights are distributed here. RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4,
GLM-5.3-Flash, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash, MiniMax-H3 and any other checkpoint
referenced in documentation or tests remain subject to their own licenses and
terms of use, which you must satisfy independently.

Model families referenced by the recipes and measured in docs/v100/:

    Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4 (RadixArk) -- the primary validation target
      https://huggingface.co/RadixArk/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4
    GLM-5.3-Flash, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash, MiniMax-H3 -- additional sm70 recipes

Documentation provenance
------------------------

The measurements in docs/v100/ come from two sources and are labelled as such:

  * "this fork" numbers were re-measured on 4x V100-SXM2-32GB at a 150 W cap with
    the harness described in docs/v100/PERFORMANCE-TUNING.md;
  * "predecessor" numbers are quoted from the sglang-sxm2 fork's records, which
    may have been taken on different hardware and power limits.

Absolute throughput is only comparable within one power configuration; see the
measurement caveat in docs/v100/PERFORMANCE-TUNING.md.

